  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Integrated Sexual Health WISH Dividend Global Goods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of a robust body of research, policy and communications work that will generate, disseminate and engage with national and global partners around rigorous evidence-based sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) data and analyses. The projects under this initiative provide actionable and timely data that will fill critical evidence gaps on abortion in select countries in Sub-Saharan Africa and address FCDO&#x2019;s priorities under the WISH Dividend programme. 
This body of work includes a set of strategic and impactful projects that harness expertise in generating, analyzing and communicating the highest standard of SRHR evidence and policy.</narrative>
  </description>
